row         Filter: (a IS NOT NULL)
EXPLAIN
> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM pp WHERE a IS NULL
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Seq Scan on pc pp
row   Filter: (a IS NULL)
