> EXPLAIN (VERBOSE, COSTS OFF) SELECT COALESCE(a, 0), b FROM pp
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Result
row   Output: COALESCE(pp.a, 0), pp.b
row   ->  Append
row         ->  Seq Scan on public.pp pp_1
row               Output: pp_1.a, pp_1.b
row         ->  Seq Scan on public.pc pp_2
row               Output: pp_2.a, pp_2.b
EXPLAIN
> EXPLAIN (VERBOSE, COSTS OFF) UPDATE pp SET b = 1 WHERE a IS NULL
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Update on public.pp
row   Update on public.pc pp_1
row   ->  Result
row         Output: 1, pp_1.tableoid, pp_1.ctid
row         ->  Seq Scan on public.pc pp_1
row               Output: pp_1.tableoid, pp_1.ctid
row               Filter: (pp_1.a IS NULL)
EXPLAIN
> EXPLAIN (VERBOSE, COSTS OFF) DELETE FROM pp WHERE a IS NOT NULL AND b = 2
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Delete on public.pp
row   Delete on public.pp pp_1
row   Delete on public.pc pp_2
row   ->  Append
row         ->  Seq Scan on public.pp pp_1
row               Output: pp_1.tableoid, pp_1.ctid
row               Filter: (pp_1.b = 2)
row         ->  Seq Scan on public.pc pp_2
row               Output: pp_2.tableoid, pp_2.ctid
row               Filter: ((pp_2.a IS NOT NULL) AND (pp_2.b = 2))
EXPLAIN
> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM ONLY pp WHERE a IS NULL
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Result
row   Replaces: Scan on pp
row   One-Time Filter: false
EXPLAIN
